      "side": 1,
      "message": "We are currently excluding the public dawn API and tint. Replay could be added to the command line if we believe this makes sense to have an exclusion.\n\n```\n  _exclusions \u003d [\n    \"/include/\",\n    \"/src/tint/\",\n  ]\n```\n\nI believe it doesn\u0027t hurt to have `raw_ptr` there. You get some additional memory safety checks in tests. The dependency is optional and disappear for embedders that do not explicitly add it.\n \nI would like @cwallez@chromium.org input for adding this exception. Every possible outcome SGTM.",
